--- .gitignore (原始)
```
# Dependencies
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.env
.env.local
.env.*

# Build artifacts
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# Testing
.coverage
coverage/
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/

# Logs
*.log

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor/IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.tmp

# Distribution / packaging
*.tar.gz
*.whl
*.egg

# Environment specific
.env*
!.env.example
```

+++ .gitignore (修改后)
Nothing needs to be added to .gitignore for the given file changes, as they consist only of source/config files (.md, Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml).
